    ...
    "express": "^4.17.1",
    ...
  }
}
```

This adds Express to your project dependencies.

10. Run `npm run dev` to start your TypeScript Express server in development mode. 

Your server should be running at `http://localhost:3000`. Open your web browser and navigate to this URL to test your server.

