| **Cloud Computing** | <ul><li>Compatible with Microsoft Azure, AWS, and Google Cloud Platform</li><li>Can run Azure Stack or AWS Outposts locally</li></ul> | <ul><li>Participates in the Cloud Foundry Foundation, OpenStack, and Kubernetes communities</li><li>Supports cloud deployments with Juju, Charmed Operators, and Docker Swarm</li></ul> |

